<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-20T21:23:34.269Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:23:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran troops are now conducting airstrikes and ground assaults against Haitian gang leaders, including an airstrike on Jeff's luxury mansion and the demolition of another stronghold, killing about 20 gang members. Haitian police raids have killed at least 34 suspected gang members, while two Salvadoran soldiers were killed handling explosives during operations. The UN chief condemned a recent attack that killed 47 people, and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. The Haitian government formalised a security pact with El Salvador, deploying Salvadoran forces who are fighting gangs in Port-au-Prince. 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQYU0yT2dDTzZkYmtfLTJmSS1UZTNlc0cyWk1vZEpiM3JVNzFRaGdtMHNfNHpJUjRYaEJRU0p1OFlIb1RtU19rczlWclNCaGkxTVJaX2lybVFVa0pSc0stNVU2dFpaUHlMTWw0Y2R5c1d4SVVpS3NZdEY2X0RrWlNGdmJXVEtsSUdGSnJ4VWZEVjlHZHp5ckZkYU5vMDJpU0pnU1Z3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOUHp5UXdvRXdscnFmZzdOTkJ2aGpoVzRra2U3Q3kyMmdPaXljdExsYXp1T0VrZ2tDUEctYzBZU05iZ0JNdDB5MHMwamFIUnBCdGNpd0taZUozTTQyWV9VRENnT3R3bUdTOEJ3NkFqRGNxTm9MWmRzQ2xPdG8ycWp3NDVyakNuSUQ3Nk03Z2wyWmE0N0NGZ2ZoYXUyN1VycnFxWlM0bHNUemZGcG_SAbABQVVfeXFMTmxHekRqX05oOHBHTzBLYzBUeENieEhBVTd6Ynp6ZHA1MnJpNHJDREdOd1l3bXJMa1dIZmtYTXU5ZEk0bUt0RU1aWlJTa1RXaHZEV0p6RjZaeXZuTlpnblZ4VW9zcTMyM2dFQTBoSjFORGhwdEI0M1NoVlVYUEg4TGR5YTZLWkpWU0h3MUlaX3dHMlQwVUxHcnptcU54LXJ6RHM4NEt6V2FMd0JobHJMbzk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new